      "instructions": "Write only supplied English artwork text. International B2B English: specific operational question, accountable actor, concrete next step. No idioms, slogans, invented ROI or cultural stereotypes. Keep scenes and narrative order. No Vietnamese words from references. Preserve exact English spelling and supplied line breaks. Review longer words at 333px; reflow or reduce illustration space before shrinking type. Do not invent hyphenation. B13v5 bright white/blue photographic campaign family. Reference wording is not approved copy. Official supplied logo once; no extra DIGIWIN header. Exact category/sequence near logo. Body comfortably readable at333CSSpx. Source normal full-width main paragraph on white, at least body-sized. All paper blank; no bars/rules/charts/ticks/data glyphs/UI/customer geography/seal/badge. Only approved artwork words. Partner handoff questions are not forecast accuracy or automatic replanning claims. Reduce scene before type."
